    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated along the highly regarded Park Road in Monaghan Town, this attractive detached residence extends to approximately 90 m² and offers a well-proportioned and versatile home in a mature and established setting. The property presents an excellent opportunity for a range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, downsizers, investors alike\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright and practical throughout and can comfortably provide two or three bedrooms, depending on the purchaser's requirements. The property offers a versatile layout with well-proportioned living accommodation, making it equally suitable as a manageable family home, a comfortable retirement residence or an investment property.\r\nExternally, the property is set on a mature and private site, surrounded by beautifully maintained gardens and established planting. A generous gravel driveway provides excellent off-street parking, while the surrounding grounds offer a pleasant degree of privacy and an attractive setting for the property.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular feature, with Monaghan Town centre and its extensive range of amenities within easy reach. The town offers a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities, healthcare services and everyday conveniences, while the property also enjoys excellent access to the town's road network and surrounding areas.\r\nThe property's detached nature, manageable accommodation and convenient location make it particularly appealing to first-time buyers, downsizers and investors, while the flexibility of the bedroom accommodation provides scope to adapt the property to suit individual requirements.\r\n\r\nThis property represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-positioned home within Monaghan Town.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment \r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nEntrance Lobby\t\t1.45m x 1.08m\t\t\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t\t3.52m x 2.00m\t\r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t\t2.42m x 3.17m\r\n\r\nSitting Room / Bedroom 3 \t3.65m x 3.65m\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Room\t\t3.65m x 3.65m\r\n\r\nRear Lobby\t\t\t1.50m x 1.25m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t\t\t3.64m x 3.64m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\t\t\t3.10m x 3.64m\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.62m x 2.05m\r\n\r\nHotpress\t\t\t1.00m x 1.15m\r\n\r\nUtility\t\t\t\t2.48m x 2.48m"
